      "mergeID": "69b05c575e994450744a3996",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This feature holds significant potential for enhancing the suspense in horror games\n\nThe ability for players to communicate audibly, especially during intense moments when a monster is nearby, adds a layer of realism and tension\n\nThe current situation, where players can shout at each other without any impact on the in-game environment, somewhat diminishes the overall horror experience",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add udon api to capture and measure player microphone audio levels",
